[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7328.75, "timestamp": "02:02:08", "text": "請大家看一下這裡。裡面"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7334.03, "timestamp": "02:02:14", "text": "內容來自天空會。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7336.75, "timestamp": "02:02:16", "text": "正如你們許多人可能知道的那樣，在某個特定時期"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7340.47, "timestamp": "02:02:20", "text": "突然，天空社團出現在索拉里斯上空。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7342.91, "timestamp": "02:02:22", "text": "塔。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7347.03, "timestamp": "02:02:27", "text": "那一刻，這頓飯充滿了高密度的迴響能量。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7350.87, "timestamp": "02:02:30", "text": "我看見了一位白神女子。那隻是一瞬間。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7354.27, "timestamp": "02:02:34", "text": "然而，那道陰影給我們留下了許多謎團。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7356.95, "timestamp": "02:02:36", "text": "這是正確的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7361.35, "timestamp": "02:02:41", "text": "什麼是研究小組？它能完成什麼工作？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7365.149, "timestamp": "02:02:45", "text": "他為何會出現？套餐是SkyAqua"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7368.47, "timestamp": "02:02:48", "text": "在那裡進行的研究旨在揭開這些謎團。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7371.43, "timestamp": "02:02:51", "text": "正是為了這個目的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7373.87, "timestamp": "02:02:53", "text": "在系統中註冊您的權限並跟隨操作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7376.629, "timestamp": "02:02:56", "text": "請。"}]